The derivative keeps the original customer research framework and adds:

- China-only, global-only, and hybrid market routing
- China internet source selection and platform-bias guidance
- LINUX DO as an AI and developer community source
- Cross-market evidence separation, source deduplication, and confidence rules
- China-oriented privacy, access-control, and research safety guidance
- Evidence handoff formats for requirements analysis and PRDs

